  "name": "Incident Report",
  "description": "Workplace incident report: who was involved, when and where, injury details, witnesses, immediate actions, root cause and photos.",
  "category": "Operations & IT",
  "seoTitle": "Free Workplace Incident Report Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Incident report form template for workplace injuries, near misses and property damage: time, place, people involved, witnesses, first aid, causes and photos.",
  "keywords": [
